flowchart LR
    A[Temperature<br/>Measurement] --> B[Expansion Type<br/>e.g. mercury thermometer<br/>bimetallic strip]
    A --> C[Vapour Pressure Type<br/>liquid-to-vapour state change<br/>pressure ∝ temp]
    A --> D[Electrical Type<br/>Resistance bulb RTD<br/>Thermocouple Seebeck Effect]
    A --> E[Radiation Type<br/>Pyrometry<br/>emissivity-based optical]
